    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.poster.avif?t=1754614752\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.webm?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.mp4?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a professional ghost hunter, you are contracted with subduing a group of trouble-causing succubi. You weren't the best option, but you were the only one left for the boss to call. As all other hunters and exorcists have failed their mission and felled to the seduction antics of the succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To not get fired, ensure you are able to subdue and bone all succubi haunting the mansion without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting Havens offers two ways to risk your dignity and sanity: <u>Arcade Mode and Story Mode</u> (coming soon).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arcade Mode, due to some <i>unfortunate</i> budget cuts (thanks, boss), you\u2019ll need to earn money each night to buy the necessary tools to subdue a bunch of dangerously hot ghosts. You\u2019re stuck in this haunted hellhole until 4:00 A.M., and if your sanity drops too low, the succubi will make their move. And let\u2019s just say\u2026 they don\u2019t take &quot;no&quot; for an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught? Prepare for some very hands-on consequences. But if you\u2019re the type to <i>plan ahead</i>, certain shop purchases and, let\u2019s call them <i>creative decisions</i>, can unlock extra encounters. You know, for &quot;science.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.poster.avif?t=1754614752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.webm?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.mp4?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode will take you on a full-blown adventure, where you\u2019ll travel through different haunted locations, meet new supernatural species, and subdue even more rogue succubi. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover the dark secrets of their origins, while also finding yourself in <i>way too many compromising situations</i>. Eventually, you\u2019ll face the Succubus Queen herself\u2014and whether you conquer her or surrender to her, is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you brave enough to fight back? Or will you end up as just another toy for the succubi\u2019s pleasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final mission? Face the Succubus Queen\u2014the one behind every sultry spirit you\u2019ve encountered. She knows you\u2019re coming, and trust me, she\u2019s been waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart her and break her to stop the cycle of hauntings? Or will you end up on your knees in ways you didn\u2019t quite expect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s for you to find out. Just try to keep your sanity intact\u2014because once you lose it, you\u2019re hers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.poster.avif?t=1754614752\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.webm?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/5ba73dc5d29b221743bf23f5289f62e6.mp4?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a professional ghost hunter, you are contracted with subduing a group of trouble-causing succubi. You weren't the best option, but you were the only one left for the boss to call. As all other hunters and exorcists have failed their mission and felled to the seduction antics of the succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To not get fired, ensure you are able to subdue and bone all succubi haunting the mansion without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting Havens offers two ways to risk your dignity and sanity: <u>Arcade Mode and Story Mode</u> (coming soon).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arcade Mode, due to some <i>unfortunate</i> budget cuts (thanks, boss), you\u2019ll need to earn money each night to buy the necessary tools to subdue a bunch of dangerously hot ghosts. You\u2019re stuck in this haunted hellhole until 4:00 A.M., and if your sanity drops too low, the succubi will make their move. And let\u2019s just say\u2026 they don\u2019t take &quot;no&quot; for an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught? Prepare for some very hands-on consequences. But if you\u2019re the type to <i>plan ahead</i>, certain shop purchases and, let\u2019s call them <i>creative decisions</i>, can unlock extra encounters. You know, for &quot;science.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.poster.avif?t=1754614752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.webm?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377770/extras/14d28994382162a323ecb9bc86935480.mp4?t=1754614752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode will take you on a full-blown adventure, where you\u2019ll travel through different haunted locations, meet new supernatural species, and subdue even more rogue succubi. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover the dark secrets of their origins, while also finding yourself in <i>way too many compromising situations</i>. Eventually, you\u2019ll face the Succubus Queen herself\u2014and whether you conquer her or surrender to her, is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you brave enough to fight back? Or will you end up as just another toy for the succubi\u2019s pleasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final mission? Face the Succubus Queen\u2014the one behind every sultry spirit you\u2019ve encountered. She knows you\u2019re coming, and trust me, she\u2019s been waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart her and break her to stop the cycle of hauntings? Or will you end up on your knees in ways you didn\u2019t quite expect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s for you to find out. Just try to keep your sanity intact\u2014because once you lose it, you\u2019re hers.</p>",
